Description: [Mozio] - The Promo code amount is NOT displayed as expected for Return trip tickets in the Mozio email confirmation

Proposed verification criteria:
1. Given a booking with a promo code that includes a return trip, when the Mozio confirmation email is opened, then the return trip ticket section displays the correct promo code discount amount
2. Given a booking with a promo code that includes a return trip, when the Mozio confirmation email is opened, then the discount amount is visible in the return trip ticket section without requiring any interaction beyond viewing the email
3. Given a booking with a promo code covering multiple legs, when the Mozio confirmation email is opened, then the correct discount amount is shown in each ticket section of the email
